SkyStream: CloudStream's WebViewResolver asks the app that embeds the library first
(WebViewResolverHost.resolver, set by the engine), so its pages load in the app's own browser on
every platform. Unset, it works as upstream's: Android's in a WebView of its own, the JVM's
(a TODO() upstream) finding nothing instead of throwing.

